# Agent-Bus Push Reminder

## Invariant

∀ turn where the agent posts or replies on the agent-bus with `--to claude-web` (or any web-claude target): end the assistant turn with a visible push reminder.

## Reminder Format

After the turn's substantive content, add:

> **Action needed — push to web claude**: reply posted to thread {ID} turn {N}. Push the agent-bus message to trigger web claude's turn.

## When It Fires

- Any `scripts/agent-bus reply --to claude-web ...` call
- Any `scripts/agent-bus post --to web ...` call (new thread)
- Any `scripts/agent-bus reply --to web ...` call

## When It Does NOT Fire

- Replies to other agents (`--to cursor`, `--to grok`, etc.)
- Peek / fetch / read-only operations
- Thread state updates with no reply posted
